name:           turndown
version:        0.1.0.0
synopsis:       HTML to Markdown, a port of the turndown JavaScript library
description:    Converts HTML to Markdown with the output of turndown 7.2.4
                (https://github.com/mixmark-io/turndown), character for character: the
                same DOM (an HTML5 parse), the same white space handling, rules, escaping
                and options. See README.md.
category:       Text
homepage:       https://github.com/rinn7e/haskell-package/tree/master/package/turndown-hs#readme
bug-reports:    https://github.com/rinn7e/haskell-package/issues
author:         Moremi Vannak
